title: "open-phase-ensemble: Non-Parametric Multi-Tool Ensemble for Time-Series Anomaly Detection and Forecasting"
message: "If you use this software in academic work or benchmarks, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "open-phase-ensemble Contributors"
