abstract: "A non-parametric, multi-tool ensemble for time-series anomaly detection and forecasting featuring Simplex Projection EDM, Ledoit-Wolf Mahalanobis distance, single-window Matrix Profile, Isolation Forest, AR Linear Ridge Filter, MSE Transformer Autoencoder, and Hedge online multiplicative weights."
